<p>Listing events on this calendar is exclusively for Ontario Nature the 150+ member groups that form our <a href="https://eml-pcan01.app.blackbaud.net/intv2/j/764F132B-8F1C-4D61-8815-DDA9466341B7/r/764F132B-8F1C-4D61-8815-DDA9466341B7_089c259a-7bb1-4350-bf52-3ac7fb2e9cf4/l/1F98156B-7EE6-4E61-92D4-E7EF59F6B553/c" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-link-type="1" data-href="https://ontarionature.org/about/nature-network" data-link-id="1F98156B-7EE6-4E61-92D4-E7EF59F6B553">Nature Network</a>.</p><div class='mailmunch-forms-in-post-middle' style='display: none !important;'></div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">To submit your public events to our online calendar, email them to <a href="mailto:noahc@ontarionature.org">noahc@ontarionature.org</a> and allow up to a week for posting. Please send only events that are open to the public and no more than three per month.</p>


<div class='mailmunch-forms-after-post' style='display: none !important;'></div>            </div>
